AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002211> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/valid_for_gocam>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002211> "regulates"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002211> "regulates (processual)")
