AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000232> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002567> "Do not use this relation directly. It is ended as a grouping for a diverse set of relations, all involving the biomechanical processes.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002567> "biomechanically related to")
