AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002569> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002259>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002569> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ro/subsets#ro-eco>)
