AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000432> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/core#human_reference_atlas>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000432> "reticular cell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000432> "https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1472")
