# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0008046> (extrafusal muscle fiber)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "DOI:10.1016/B978-0-443-10321-6.00004-7") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Wikipedia:Extrafusal_muscle_fiber&oldid=978415293") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0008046> "A skeletal muscle fiber that is innervated by alpha motor neuron and generates tension by contracting, thereby allowing for skeletal movement. These fibers make up the large mass of skeletal muscle tissue and are attached to bones by tendons.")
