# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0008047> (intrafusal muscle fiber)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "DOI:10.1016/B978-0-443-10321-6.00004-7") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Wikipedia:Intrafusal_muscle_fiber&oldid=937508784") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0008047> "A skeletal muscle fiber that is part of a muscle spindle. These are specialized muscle fibers that serve as proprioceptors, detecting the amount and rate of change in length of a muscle. They are innervated by both sensory neurons and motor neurons (gamma and beta motorneurons, collectively referred to as fusimotor neurons).")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0008047> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0008047> "2020-09-26T21:07:01Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
