# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0009098> (fetal and neonatal skeletal muscle fiber)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:26180627") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:7196501") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2034-601X") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0009098> "A skeletal muscle fiber found at the fetal and neonatal stages. In mammalian fetuses and neonates, skeletal muscle expresses myosin heavy chain-neonatal (MyHC-neo, encoded by the MYH8 gene). This expression disappears shortly after birth and is replaced by expression of adult heavy chain myosins.")
