# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4052041> (tuft cell of auditory tube)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:30379593") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:32733896") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4052041> "A tuft cell that is part of the epithelium of the pharyngotympanic (auditory) tube. This chemosensory cell is often positioned near cholinoreceptive sensory nerve fibers, suggesting a role in neuroimmune communication. It detects chemical signals and releases neuropeptides, such as acetylcholine (ACh) and CGRP, which contribute to inflammatory responses that help protect deeper tissues from harmful substances.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4052041> <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4052041> "2025-02-12T12:00:10Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4052041> "tuft cell of auditory tube")
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4052041> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002204> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0010062>)))
