# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4052060> (spinous cell)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:34283481") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "wikipedia:Spinous_cell") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4052060> "A differentiating keratinocyte found in the epidermis and oral epithelium, located in the stratum spinosum, characterized by a spiny appearance due to abundant intercellular desmosomal junctions.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_4052060> <https://orcid.org/0009-0000-8480-9277>)
