AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:jal") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GO_REF:0000022") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ISBN:081533642X") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0002467> "The process in which germinal centers form. A germinal center is a specialized microenvironment formed when activated B cells enter lymphoid follicles. Germinal centers are the foci for B cell proliferation and somatic hypermutation.")
