# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0014029> (neural crest formation)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:dh") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:ef") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0014029> "The formation of the specialized region of ectoderm between the neural ectoderm (neural plate) and non-neural ectoderm. The neural crest gives rise to the neural crest cells that migrate away from this region as neural tube formation proceeds.")
