# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0035316> (non-sensory hair organization)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:mtg_sensu") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:11064425") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0035316> "A process that is carried out at the cellular level which results in the assembly, arrangement of constituent parts, or disassembly of non-sensory hairs. These hairs are polarized cellular extensions that cover much of the insect epidermis.")
