# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0072113> (head kidney development)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "ZFA:0000669") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0072113> "The process whose specific outcome is the progression of the head kidney over time, from its formation to the mature structure. The head kidney is a pronephros that consists of fused bilateral lobes located in the anterior part of the kidney. It is analogous to the mammalian bone marrow and the primary site of definitive hematopoiesis.")
