# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NBO_0000327> (somatic sensation related behavior)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "OBP:GVG") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NBO_0000327> "Behavior related to the sensations arising from the skin and from the muscles, tendons, and joints.")
