AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001294> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pato#attribute_slim>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001294> "radiation reflective quality")
