AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#id> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001400> "PATO:0001400")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001400> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pato#cell_quality>)
