AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001400> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/pato#value_slim>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001400> "Unipotent cells have the quality of self-renewal which distinguishes them from non-stem cells.")
